BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Conversations About Inspiration Hosted by Sondra Hall
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T200000
UID:be44fb403c19fa217d4e0ac4084b24b9@littlejumbobar.com
DESCRIPTION:You're invited to a special evening at Little Jumbo called Con
 versations About Inspiration on November 11th from 6:30 - 8:30 pm.\n\nThis
  project is born out of my long-time marriage to musician and composer\, A
 lan Hall. I'm fascinated and mystified that his artistic inspiration comes
  in the form of sound and rhythm. As a wordsmith\, mine is sparked by word
 s.\n\nThis contrast led me to wonder about how artists from all different 
 disciplines transform inspiration into art. Are there common threads betwe
 en\, say\, a sculptor and a composer? What about a dancer and an abstract 
 painter?\n\nOn November 11th from 6:30 - 8:30 I'll be facilitating a dialo
 gue\, followed by audience Q & A\, between two women artists from Ashevill
 e: Catherine Baumhauer and Kelle Jolly. Catherine is a mixed media artist 
 a...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/2345/conversations-about-inspira
 tion-hosted-by-sondra-hall
X-SOURCE:Little Jumbo
END:VEVENT
